OL,3,GNEWSA'Our son was murdered over a #20
OL,4,Acannabis debt'
OL,5,
OL,6,FYvette Bullen was working a shift at
OL,7,Fthe Morrisons supermarket in Seaford
OL,8,Fwhen she received a phone call.
OL,10,FIt was the mother of the girlfriend of
OL,11,Fher son Josh Ingram, telling her he had
OL,12,Fbeen stabbed.
OL,14,F"I dropped everything, flew out of work
OL,15,Fto see him on laying on a stretcher in
OL,16,Fthe road with them working on him," she
OL,17,Fsaid.
OL,19,FJosh, 16, had been attacked at the
OL,20,Fnearby railway station.
